# Networks of your own load balancers that send the PROXY protocol header
# (version 1 or 2) at the start of each connection to HAProxy. HAProxy then
# uses the client address in this header. A connection from these networks
# without the header is closed. Write one network per line, for example:
# 203.0.113.0/24
